---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const divisions = [
	{ id: 'build', label: 'Build', intro: 'Software and sites built to be handed over.', items: ['Web applications', 'Website design', 'E-commerce', 'Integrations'] },
	{ id: 'market', label: 'Market', intro: 'Demand generation from accounts you own.', items: ['Paid advertising', 'Search optimization', 'Email and retention', 'Analytics'] },
	{ id: 'create', label: 'Create', intro: 'The material every campaign and product needs.', items: ['Video and photography', 'Podcast and audio', 'Brand assets', 'Copy and landing pages'] },
	{ id: 'sell', label: 'Sell', intro: 'The commerce work that keeps revenue moving.', items: ['Store operations', 'Digital products', 'Merchandise', 'Marketplaces'] },
];

const sectors = [
	['Local and small business', 'Clear offers, local discovery and enquiry systems that do not lose leads.'],
	['Churches and nonprofits', 'Accessible websites, giving journeys, events and communications your team can manage.'],
	['Schools and education', 'Fast paths for students, families, staff and community partners.'],
	['Healthcare and clinics', 'Trust-first content, accessible intake and privacy-aware workflows.'],
];
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Lead Strategy | Build, market, create and sell in Canada"
	description="Lead Strategy builds websites, marketing systems, content and commerce for Canadian small businesses and community organizations."
>
	<section class="hero">
		<img class="hero__image" src="/images/lead-strategy-hero.webp" alt="Creative production tools and an architectural model arranged on a dark studio table" width="1920" height="1080" fetchpriority="high" />
		<div class="hero__inner shell">
			<p class="kicker kicker--light">Digital strategy and production across Canada</p>
			<h1>Make the work bring work in.</h1>
			<p class="hero__lead">We build the website, grow its reach, produce what it needs, and connect the sale. One team, four divisions, and the accounts and files stay yours.</p>
			<div class="button-row">
				<a class="button button--orange" href="/contact/">Book a call</a>
				<a class="button button--dark-outline" href="/services/">Explore services</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="signal-strip" aria-label="Lead Strategy divisions">
		<div class="signal-strip__inner shell"><span>Build</span><i></i><span>Market</span><i></i><span>Create</span><i></i><span>Sell</span></div>
	</div>

	<section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
		<div class="section__head">
			<div><p class="kicker">Four connected divisions</p><h2 id="services-heading">Bring one problem or the whole system.</h2></div>
			<p>Start with the part that is blocking growth. We can deliver one focused project or connect the website, marketing, creative and commerce work so information stops being re-entered and opportunities stop getting lost.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="division-grid">
			{divisions.map((division) => (
				<a class="division" href={`/services/#${division.id}`}>
					<span class="division__label">{division.label}</span>
					<h3>{division.label}</h3>
					<p>{division.intro}</p>
					<ul>{division.items.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
				</a>
			))}
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="image-story">
		<img class="image-story__image" src="/images/connected-systems.webp" alt="A physical model of connected routes linking several small structures" width="1280" height="1280" loading="lazy" />
		<div class="image-story__copy">
			<p class="kicker kicker--light">Connected by design</p>
			<h2>One change should improve more than one thing.</h2>
			<p>A faster website should also be easier to find. A lead form should reach the right person and the reporting dashboard. Product content should work in your store, advertising and email. We plan the connections before we add the tools.</p>
			<div><a class="button button--orange" href="/services/">See how we work</a></div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section shell" aria-labelledby="sectors-heading">
		<div class="section__head">
			<div><p class="kicker">Who we serve</p><h2 id="sectors-heading">Built for organizations doing real work.</h2></div>
			<p>Our approach fits organizations that need practical growth, clear ownership and systems a small team can actually maintain.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="sector-list">
			{sectors.map(([name, description]) => (
				<a class="sector-row" href="/sectors/"><span>{name}</span><p>{description}</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
			))}
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--orange">
		<div class="proof-grid shell">
			<figure><img src="/images/create-and-sell.webp" alt="Camera, paper, material samples and product packaging on a dark work surface" width="1080" height="1350" loading="lazy" /></figure>
			<div class="proof-grid__copy">
				<p class="kicker">What ownership means</p>
				<h2>Your business should not be trapped in ours.</h2>
				<p>The repository, accounts, source files and documentation belong to you. We design for handover from the first week, even when you ask us to keep operating the system after launch.</p>
				<ul class="commitments">
					<li>Repository access from day one</li>
					<li>Accounts registered in your organization</li>
					<li>Source files and practical documentation included</li>
					<li>No link schemes, mystery fees or hidden dependencies</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
		<div class="shell">
			<div class="section__head">
				<div><p class="kicker kicker--light">A clear working rhythm</p><h2 id="process-heading">See progress every week.</h2></div>
				<p>Short cycles make risks visible early. You can review the work in a browser, make decisions while they are still inexpensive, and always know what ships next.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="process-grid">
				<div class="process-step"><span>DISCOVER</span><h3>Define the job</h3><p>We agree on the buyer, the outcome, the evidence and the first useful release.</p></div>
				<div class="process-step"><span>DELIVER</span><h3>Review weekly</h3><p>You receive a working staging link and a short decision list every week.</p></div>
				<div class="process-step"><span>IMPROVE</span><h3>Measure and refine</h3><p>After launch, real search, lead and sales data decides what we improve next.</p></div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="closing-cta">
		<div class="closing-cta__inner shell">
			<div><p class="kicker">Start with the blocker</p><h2>What needs to work better first?</h2><p>Bring the stalled site, the weak campaign, the missing content or the store that takes too much time to run.</p></div>
			<a class="button button--orange" href="/contact/">Book a call</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
